WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.900
What's up guys!

00:00:00.900 --> 00:00:01.700
We are Pongfinity

00:00:01.820 --> 00:00:03.140
Many of you have requested us

00:00:03.140 --> 00:00:05.080
to make a Pongfinity mobile game battle

00:00:05.260 --> 00:00:06.220
Between the three of us

00:00:06.460 --> 00:00:07.920
So today we will see who is the champion

00:00:08.420 --> 00:00:09.920
And to make it a bit more exciting

00:00:10.020 --> 00:00:11.620
Everybody will draw a random bat

00:00:11.880 --> 00:00:12.580
Random ball

00:00:12.760 --> 00:00:13.620
And a random map

00:00:13.780 --> 00:00:15.860
Each of us get one try, let's see who wins!

00:00:16.040 --> 00:00:16.700
Otto starts

00:00:19.140 --> 00:00:21.560
Ok I will try to pick the winning combination

00:00:21.560 --> 00:00:22.980
Let's start with the racket

00:00:23.700 --> 00:00:24.820
A guitar.

00:00:24.820 --> 00:00:27.480
That's not really good for my character

00:00:27.480 --> 00:00:30.000
Otto plus guitar is a pretty slow combination

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:31.660
Yeah, really slow!

00:00:35.060 --> 00:00:37.120
Balloon!

00:00:38.500 --> 00:00:40.000
That's the worst possible!

00:00:40.400 --> 00:00:43.320
Almost the worst possible combination so far!

00:00:43.780 --> 00:00:46.200
Ah, Pongfinity Hall!

00:00:46.200 --> 00:00:48.640
At least that's a nice hall!

00:00:48.640 --> 00:00:51.700
I'd be very surprised if Otto wins with that combination!

00:00:51.840 --> 00:00:53.580
It was guitar...

00:00:54.360 --> 00:00:55.440
Balloon...

00:00:55.440 --> 00:00:57.540
And Pongfinity Hall is there already

00:00:57.920 --> 00:01:01.620
And also everybody gets a Safety Net

00:01:03.300 --> 00:01:04.280
Good luck Otto!

00:01:04.280 --> 00:01:05.720
You have a winning combination

00:01:06.000 --> 00:01:11.120
No I don't - this is one of the worst combinations in the whole game.

00:01:11.120 --> 00:01:14.200
So the Safety Net means that if you miss

00:01:14.200 --> 00:01:16.100
the Safety Net will save you one time.

00:01:16.160 --> 00:01:18.020
You should take the power-up

00:01:20.660 --> 00:01:23.040
I used my Safety Net there

00:01:23.760 --> 00:01:25.980
Was that a tactical use of the Safety Net?

00:01:25.980 --> 00:01:27.020
No it wasn't.

00:01:27.560 --> 00:01:29.100
Well now you can see

00:01:29.100 --> 00:01:30.280
You got the Eye [power-up].

00:01:33.300 --> 00:01:35.120
Easily over 50!

00:01:35.120 --> 00:01:35.640
Yeah

00:01:36.680 --> 00:01:38.040
You got it but then you missed!

00:01:38.040 --> 00:01:38.960
Exactly 50!

00:01:38.960 --> 00:01:42.280
I tried an around the net but missed it

00:01:42.280 --> 00:01:44.780
Stupid game - I miss an around the net!

00:01:44.940 --> 00:01:47.360
But you said that you will get 50

00:01:47.360 --> 00:01:49.360
Yeah, I was hoping to get 50

00:01:49.360 --> 00:01:52.640
and I was happy with that so I just stopped it

00:01:52.640 --> 00:01:53.580
That's quite a good score!

00:01:53.580 --> 00:01:55.800
Okay, let's see what combination I will get.

00:01:55.800 --> 00:01:57.140
Choose your weapon first

00:02:00.860 --> 00:02:02.280
A phone!

00:02:03.800 --> 00:02:07.640
I wouldn't say that's the best choice!

00:02:08.460 --> 00:02:10.300
I don't think it has a very good reach

00:02:10.680 --> 00:02:11.700
No, it doesn't

00:02:11.960 --> 00:02:12.940
Basketball!

00:02:13.040 --> 00:02:14.920
Phone and basketball!

00:02:15.440 --> 00:02:16.900
Interesting combination!

00:02:16.900 --> 00:02:21.640
I wonder if anybody has ever played with these combinations voluntarily...

00:02:21.640 --> 00:02:22.280
Forest!

00:02:22.280 --> 00:02:23.380
That's a nice place!

00:02:23.380 --> 00:02:25.220
Agility - phone has a quite good agility

00:02:25.220 --> 00:02:27.640
Your agility is super good

00:02:27.640 --> 00:02:31.235
because my character is quite fast and the phone has a good agility

00:02:31.420 --> 00:02:32.240
Let's go!

00:02:32.400 --> 00:02:34.540
I think I will at least beat Miikka!

00:02:34.540 --> 00:02:35.635
A few warm-up rounds

00:02:35.800 --> 00:02:38.040
You know the character gotta stay warm

00:02:38.040 --> 00:02:41.940
Yeah, Miikka always needs to warm up first

00:02:42.840 --> 00:02:43.400
Good luck!

00:02:44.660 --> 00:02:45.400
WHAT!?

00:02:45.400 --> 00:02:46.520
Look at how slow it is!

00:02:46.520 --> 00:02:47.680
That's pretty slow!

00:02:49.440 --> 00:02:51.300
The Dash [move] is that slow!

00:02:51.300 --> 00:02:53.120
How is it that slow!?

00:02:53.120 --> 00:02:54.300
This is terrible

00:02:54.780 --> 00:02:56.440
Well at least I have time to think!

00:02:58.040 --> 00:02:58.840
Oh no...

00:02:58.840 --> 00:03:01.680
That was a mistake!

00:03:02.560 --> 00:03:03.780
I know where its gonna hit it

00:03:04.260 --> 00:03:05.920
You're not going to get 20 there

00:03:06.020 --> 00:03:07.780
Well you have the Safety Net still

00:03:07.780 --> 00:03:09.080
I'll get that diamond!

00:03:11.580 --> 00:03:13.100
Why did I get the diamond!?

00:03:13.100 --> 00:03:16.280
That was the classical rookie mistake - to get the diamond.

00:03:17.860 --> 00:03:19.220
Wider table [power-up]

00:03:20.620 --> 00:03:21.960
18!

00:03:21.960 --> 00:03:23.260
Good score Miikka!

00:03:23.720 --> 00:03:25.460
Way to go!

00:03:25.460 --> 00:03:27.020
At least I get a free gift

00:03:29.640 --> 00:03:30.720
Ooh, a lot of coins!

00:03:31.060 --> 00:03:32.440
Are you feeling lucky Emil?

00:03:32.440 --> 00:03:34.480
I'm not feeling particularly lucky

00:03:34.480 --> 00:03:37.600
but I think I can be luckier than you guys

00:03:37.820 --> 00:03:40.800
I'm sure I'll get the 5-star racket - the best one.

00:03:40.800 --> 00:03:42.640
4-star racket!

00:03:42.640 --> 00:03:44.120
Alrightey!

00:03:44.120 --> 00:03:45.080
Okay, the ball.

00:03:45.080 --> 00:03:46.040
Beach ball!

00:03:46.040 --> 00:03:48.560
That's not the best one - that's quite slow.

00:03:48.560 --> 00:03:52.280
Alright, the beach would be suitable for the beach ball but we'll see...

00:03:52.580 --> 00:03:54.040
No way!

00:03:54.040 --> 00:03:54.960
It's the beach!

00:03:54.960 --> 00:03:57.060
We didn't even plan this!

00:03:57.060 --> 00:03:58.660
Alright, let's go!

00:03:59.260 --> 00:04:00.980
Yeah, that goes so fast

00:04:00.980 --> 00:04:03.280
A bit faster than for Miikka

00:04:03.280 --> 00:04:04.880
with the phone and the basketball

00:04:04.880 --> 00:04:07.080
Even if you get like a score of 100

00:04:07.080 --> 00:04:08.960
it would take the same time as my 18...

00:04:10.260 --> 00:04:11.520
Pretty much yeah

00:04:11.540 --> 00:04:13.600
I think we are going to be here for a while

00:04:13.600 --> 00:04:14.280
Yup.

00:04:14.520 --> 00:04:15.440
Hopefully, yes!

00:04:15.680 --> 00:04:17.000
Okay, 4 more!

00:04:22.060 --> 00:04:23.260
Don't miss this one!

00:04:23.960 --> 00:04:24.740
The winner!

00:04:24.740 --> 00:04:26.940
But let's see how far I can go

00:04:26.940 --> 00:04:28.360
Can I get to the robot?

00:04:28.920 --> 00:04:30.640
Ooh, you're battery is dying!

00:04:30.740 --> 00:04:31.900
Quickly Emil!

00:04:31.940 --> 00:04:32.720
No!

00:04:32.720 --> 00:04:33.540
What?

00:04:33.540 --> 00:04:35.080
[Screen recording ended because of the 15% notification]

00:04:35.080 --> 00:04:36.520
Nooo!

00:04:36.640 --> 00:04:37.880
That was unlucky

00:04:38.160 --> 00:04:40.700
Hope you enjoyed this Pongfinity Game battle

00:04:40.700 --> 00:04:43.440
and hope you enjoyed seeing me win for once!

00:04:48.440 --> 00:04:49.840
Thank you Otto!

00:04:49.840 --> 00:04:51.860
If you haven't got the app yet

00:04:51.860 --> 00:04:53.100
You can download it

00:04:53.100 --> 00:04:55.520
It's free on both Apple and Android

00:04:55.800 --> 00:04:57.360
And if you want to give yourself a challenge

00:04:57.360 --> 00:04:58.860
Go and beat Emil's high score

00:04:58.880 --> 00:04:59.980
It's still the world record

00:04:59.980 --> 00:05:01.140
428!

00:05:01.140 --> 00:05:02.620
That's the score to beat for you!

00:05:02.780 --> 00:05:03.860
Otto whispering: "Emil's the best"

00:05:03.880 --> 00:05:05.000
Until next time!

